  "reviewer_note": "Least sure of the end date and fate: the pages disagree on detail (EBSCO: 6 Feb 43 traditional; National Geographic: more than two years to defeat). The Han general is named differently by the two pages, so he is left out. The earliest source, Fan Ye, wrote about four centuries later (National Geographic). Pin is modern Me Linh, a village in Hanoi, not a surveyed ancient site.",
